 "post": {
  "title": "Siri now remembers your chats",
  "caption": "Siri now remembers your past chats. 🧠\n\nWith iOS 27.2 (out 26 Oct), Siri AI can recall earlier conversations, so you can ask about something it told you before, like last week's restaurant suggestions. It also draws on more of your phone, including photos attached in Messages and your Safari history. Every app is included by default; to keep one out, go to Settings › Siri › Excluded Apps. Siri AI is in beta and not available in the EU at launch.\nSend this to someone who uses Siri every day.",
